<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 3</span>: </span><span id="S3.F3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">RealWorldQA results. SR-3D shows stronger spatial understanding of physical environments compared to the base model. We omit the answer choices for clarity in visualization.</span></figcaption>
