<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Table 2: </span>Results on BLINK<math id="S4.T3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{}_{\texttt{Depth}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">Depth</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}_{\texttt{Depth}}</annotation></semantics></math>. We follow SpatialRGPT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">18</a>]</cite>’s protocol to test whether a 3D-injected VLM effectively leverages auxiliary spatial information.</figcaption>
