<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Table 3: </span>Region-level classification results on COCO-2017 val set with ground-truth boxes, following RegionCLIP <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib65" title="" class="ltx_ref">65</a>]</cite> and RegionGPT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib17" title="" class="ltx_ref">17</a>]</cite>.</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S4.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p">We further evaluate SR-3D on the BLINK<math id="S4.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{}_{\texttt{Depth}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">Depth</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}_{\texttt{Depth}}</annotation></semantics></math> benchmark <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib77" title="" class="ltx_ref">77</a>]</cite> using the region-prompts as in SpatialRGPT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">18</a>]</cite>, which tests point-level depth understanding in VLMs. BLINK<math id="S4.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{}_{\texttt{Depth}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">Depth</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}_{\texttt{Depth}}</annotation></semantics></math> is a challenging task that requires both spatial and regional awareness. We report results in Table <a href="#S4.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ 4.1 Evaluation on 2D Benchmarks ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ 3D Aware Region Prompted Vision Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> showing that SR-3D outperforms current state-of-the-art SpatialRGPT <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib18" title="" class="ltx_ref">18</a>]</cite>, achieving 90% accuracy. These results highlight that our approach excels in region extraction and effectively utilizes the provided 3D-aware input.</p>
</div>
