<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Ablation study on the impact of incorporating 3D positional embeddings (3D PE) and single-view pre-training. We report CIDEr for Scan2Cap and ScanQA, EM for SQA3D, and the average score for both the 3D region and global benchmarks.</figcaption>
