<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>More Quantitative Results on 3D General Benchmarks</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Following prior work, we report results using additional metrics for a more comprehensive evaluation. Table <a href="#A1.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ Appendix A More Quantitative Results on 3D General Benchmarks ‣ 3D Aware Region Prompted Vision Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> presents results on Scan2Cap, Table <a href="#A1.T11" title="Table 11 ‣ Appendix A More Quantitative Results on 3D General Benchmarks ‣ 3D Aware Region Prompted Vision Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a> on ScanQA, and Table <a href="#A1.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ Appendix A More Quantitative Results on 3D General Benchmarks ‣ 3D Aware Region Prompted Vision Language Model" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a> on SQA3D. Apart from our method, all other results are from Video-3D-LLM <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">[<a href="#bib.bib16" title="" class="ltx_ref">16</a>]</cite>.</p>
</div>
